-- CASE 9. Primary victim awards (ss 38, 41-43). Answers: primary; excluded; what for; act category; injuries;
-- earnings; clothing; medical; exceptional; interim; s 41; s 42; then s 43: (a) not entitled; reported within a
-- reasonable time; reported before the decision; prevented; failed to assist; collusion; indictable offence.
-- =====================================================================================================================

-- Ben: broken arm (6.7(a)) and lost teeth (5.5(c)): standard 10 000 + 1 200 = 11 200 (threshold 14 000 met). Loss:
-- earnings 3 000 + clothing 200 + medical 1 500 = 4 700, under $10 000. 11 200 + 4 700 = 15 900, under $40 000.
