#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0), (`injury` "5.5(c)" FALSE 0)) 3000 200 1500 0 0 0 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the most that can be awarded, in dollars, is` 15900
#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0), (`injury` "5.5(c)" FALSE 0)) 3000 200 1500 0 0 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the most that can be awarded, in dollars, is` 15900
-- s 43(a), (d), (e), (f).
#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0)) 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no award` `s 43(a): the assessor is satisfied I am not entitled to an award`
#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0)) 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no award` `s 43(d): I failed, without reasonable excuse, to assist police in a material way`
#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0)) 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no award` `s 43(e): the application was made in collusion with the offender`
#ASSERT `How much can I be awarded as a primary victim` TRUE FALSE `compensable injuries, with financial loss` 0 (LIST (`injury` "6.7(a)" FALSE 0)) 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no award` `s 43(f): the injury or death occurred while I was committing an indictable offence`
-- Excluded by s 17 or 18; not a primary victim (s 37(1)); an unknown item.
