#ASSERT `By when must I apply for an increase` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 3 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1990) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 3 2029
-- A child paid 1 February 2026, born 10 June 2012: adult on 10 June 2030, so by 10 June 2033 (s 46(1)(b)).
#ASSERT `By when must I apply for an increase` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 10 6 2012) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 6 2033
